      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Source reliability (A to F) and information credibility (1 to 6) follow the separate intelligence grading dimensions described in UK MOD JDP 2-00, fourth edition, Table 3.1. This application is informed by public UK and NATO doctrine; it is not NATO-accredited and does not establish full doctrinal compliance.",
